HTML = r'''<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>商品证据工作台</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css"><script src="/app.js" defer></script></head>
<body><div class="shell"><aside class="rail"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">证</span><div>商品证据工作台<small>PRODUCT EVIDENCE GUARD</small></div></div>
<p class="rail-label">本次任务</p><h1 id="project-name">正在读取资料</h1><p id="phase" class="muted">连接本地核验服务…</p>
<nav aria-label="工作流"><button class="nav active" data-view="review"><span>01</span>核对与确认<b id="pending-count">—</b></button><button class="nav" data-view="handoff"><span>02</span>授权与内容回检</button><button class="nav" data-view="deliverables"><span>03</span>交付与更新追踪</button></nav>
<div class="resident"><span class="signal" id="model-signal"></span><strong id="model-status">读取模型状态</strong><p id="model-description">本地处理 · 原始资料保留在本机</p><button id="keep-alive" class="text-button">开启演示常驻</button></div>
<div class="rail-foot">正常参数直接确认，只处理实际疑问</div></aside>
<main><header class="topbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">本地商品参数</span><h2 id="view-title">先处理有问题的参数。</h2></div><div class="actions"><button id="refresh" class="secondary">刷新状态</button><button id="reanalyze" class="secondary">重新分析</button><select id="export-mode" aria-label="导出范围"><option value="verified">全部已确认参数</option><option value="human">仅人工批准参数</option></select><button id="export" class="primary">导出参数表</button></div></header>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="notice" hidden></div><div id="progress" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="progress" hidden></div>
<div class="overview"><span class="stat conflict"><b id="conflict-count">—</b>冲突</span><span class="stat pending_confirmation"><b id="review-count">—</b>待确认</span><span class="stat verified"><b id="confirmed-count">—</b>已确认</span><span class="overview-end"><span id="evidence-count">—</span>条底层记录 · <span id="files-count">—</span>份资料<br><small id="elapsed">—</small></span></div>
<section id="view-review"><div class="section-head"><div><h3>参数审核</h3><p>清楚且无冲突的参数已直接确认；详情按需展开。</p></div><div class="review-filters"><select id="product-filter" aria-label="按商品筛选"><option value="">全部商品</option></select><select id="source-filter" aria-label="按来源筛选"><option value="">全部来源</option></select><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="筛选参数"><button class="selected" data-filter="all">全部</button><button data-filter="conflict">冲突</button><button data-filter="pending_confirmation">待确认</button><button data-filter="verified">已确认</button></div></div></div>
<div class="batchbar" id="batchbar" hidden><span id="selection-count">已选择 0 条</span><button id="batch-confirm" class="small-action adopt">批量确认</button><button id="batch-reject" class="small-action">批量拒绝</button><button id="clear-selection" class="text-button">清空选择</button><span class="muted">只处理明确勾选项；不会自动拒绝同组其他值。</span></div>
<div class="review-grid"><div id="groups" class="groups" aria-label="参数列表"></div><aside class="evidence" id="evidence-panel" hidden><div class="evidence-top"><span class="eyebrow">来源证据</span><h3 id="evidence-title">选择一条来源</h3><p id="evidence-location">点击参数下的“查看证据”，在这里核对原始内容。</p></div><div id="evidence-content" class="evidence-content"><div class="empty-visual">文件 · 页码 · 单元格<br><span>每个参数，都有来处。</span></div></div><p id="evidence-note" class="muted"></p></aside></div></section>
<section id="view-handoff" hidden><div class="section-head"><div><h3>选择允许交给 Qoder 的参数</h3><p>这里只包含当前有效的已确认值。原图、证据原文和审核理由留在本地。</p></div></div><div class="handoff-grid"><div class="panel"><div id="approved-fields"></div><label for="purpose">本次使用目的</label><input id="purpose" value="生成商品介绍与参数表，并回检商品参数"><button id="authorize" class="primary wide">授权选中的参数给 Qoder</button><p class="muted">此操作在本机建立授权；Qoder 获取字段包后才会进入它的模型上下文。</p><div id="bundles"></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>回检生成的文案</h3><p>检查型号、重量、尺寸、数量和电气参数是否符合授权事实。</p><label for="bundle-select">使用的字段授权</label><select id="bundle-select"></select><label for="draft">文案内容</label><textarea id="draft" rows="9" placeholder="例如：产品型号：PEG-01。净重：320g。"></textarea><button id="check" class="primary wide">保存草稿并在本地回检</button><div id="check-result" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>
<section id="view-deliverables" hidden><div class="section-head"><div><h3>交付件与更新影响</h3><p>资料发生变化后，定位需要重做的内容。文案修改后需要重新回检。</p></div></div><div id="deliverables"></div></section>
<footer>自动核验与人工决定分别记录。内容回检仅覆盖已识别的商品字段，营销表述仍需人工审核。</footer></main></div>
<dialog id="decision-dialog"><form id="decision-form"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="decision-title">确认采用该参数</h2><button type="button" class="icon-button" id="close-dialog" aria-label="关闭">×</button></div><p id="decision-value"></p><label for="reason">处理说明</label><textarea id="reason" rows="3" required maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：已与供应商核对，这是当前有效版本。"></textarea><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" id="cancel-dialog" class="secondary">取消</button><button type="submit" class="primary" id="save-decision">保存决定</button></div></form></dialog>
</body></html>'''

